OL,3,AIran attacks US targets in Middle East
OL,4,Aafter five reportedly killed at wedding
OL,5,Acelebration
OL,6,
OL,7,FIran has launched missile and drone
OL,8,Fattacks at US targets across the Middle
OL,9,FEast, after American forces resumed
OL,10,Fstrikes against Iran
OL,12,FKuwait and Jordan said they were
OL,13,Fresponding to Iranian attacks early on
OL,14,FWednesday, while Iranian state media
OL,15,Freported strikes on Iraq and Bahrain
OL,17,FIt comes after the Iranian Red Crescent
OL,18,Fsaid five people - including a child -
OL,19,Fwere killed at a wedding celebration
OL,20,Fwhen shrapnel from a US missile hit a
OL,21,Fhouse in southern Iran
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31102
