OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIran attacks US targets in Middle East
OL,4,Aafter five reportedly killed at wedding
OL,5,Acelebration
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn response, Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf -
OL,8,FIran's chief negotiator in talks with
OL,9,Fthe US earlier this year - says: "If a
OL,10,Fpower acts like Satan, picks targets
OL,11,Flike Satan, and kills like Satan, it's
OL,12,FSatan"
OL,14,FThe US military says it is aware of the
OL,15,Freports but that it never targets
OL,16,Fcivilians, and was striking Iranian
OL,17,Ftargets in response to "recent
OL,18,Fattempted attacks" on American forces
OL,19,Fand commercial shipping in the Strait
OL,20,Fof Hormuz
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
